# AI in Business: Amazon Recommendation Engine

## 1. Company Overview
Amazon is the world’s largest e-commerce platform, processing over 2.5 billion visits monthly. Founded in 1994, it generated **$574 billion in revenue in 2023**, with **35% of sales driven by product recommendations**.

---

## 2. Purpose of the AI/Expert System
The **Amazon Recommendation Engine** uses AI to:
- Increase **customer engagement**
- Boost **average order value**
- Drive **35% of total revenue**
- Reduce choice overload for 300M+ products

---

## 3. Components Involved

| Component           | Description |
|---------------------|-----------|
| **Knowledge Base**  | 20+ years of user behavior: clicks, purchases, views, ratings |
| **Inference Engine**| Collaborative Filtering + Deep Learning (Neural CF) |
| **Data Layer**      | Real-time streams (Kafka), batch (S3), user profiles |
| **User Interface**  | "Customers who bought X also bought Y", "Recommended for You" |
| **Model**           | Item-to-Item Collaborative Filtering (patented 2003), Deep Neural Networks |

---

